{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207370","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1720737001:0":{"text":"色に濁りがなくて、花びらに傷ひとつない……これにしましょう！","source_cn":"颜色一尘不染，花瓣也没有一点瑕疵……就选这一束吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD650B7FCD5945C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720737002:1":{"text":"でも、茎がむき出しだと見栄えがあんまりね……王宮のお花の先生が言ってたんだけど、緑を添えてあげると花が生き生き際立つんだって！あとは色に合ったリボンも付けて……","source_cn":"可是花束的花杆光秃秃的不太好看……王宫里的花艺老师讲过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65343CBA13C5F167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720737003:1":{"text":"ペギーは王宮で学んだ生け花の技術を用い、摘んできた白いバラを丹念に整え、華やかで非の打ちところのない花束を仕上げた。","source_cn":"佩吉用她学到的宫廷插花术，将采集来的白玫瑰精心搭配成了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DA0022FCA3F96B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"白バラの花束","source_cn":"白玫瑰花束","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9E4E0B7E8995E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720737004:1":{"text":"見て、ずっときれいになったでしょ！この花束なら、きっと彼女も元気になってくれるわ！","source_cn":"看！这样就漂亮多了！这么美的花束，一定能让她好受一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE16FFF9059FA844E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document